window.products.push({"id":1095005,"name":"Buddeez Recycling Containers with Color Coded Lids, 20-Gallon/80-Quart, 3-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hTl8clhXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Buddeez makes Recycling easy with its NEW recycling centers. Buddeez recycling containers are made for every size home or office. You can use them as a Sorting Center (Plastics, Metals, Paper and or Glass) or Single Co-Mingling container. All Buddeez recycling containers are designed with a large opening lid for easy access for disposing and sealing of container. As well the Buddeez patented \"Bag Gripper\" technology - allowing for easy and safe liner placement and removal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hTl8clhXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buddeez","source_asin":"B00RBKC7CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RBKC7CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RBKC7CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1095006,"name":"NuWave Titanium PIC Induction Cooktop (formerly known as PRO)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":200.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316iQ6FEzCL._AC_.jpg","description":"A delay function also allows users to start cooking at a time most convenient for them, even if they'll be away from the kitchen. Money Savings Induction cooktops and ranges can cost thousands of dollars. We offer a state-of-the-art product at a price most families and individuals can afford. The NuWave Precision Induction Cooktop's low price point is one of its greatest assets. But there's so much more. In today's challenging economic climate and considering the rising cost of food staples, every penny counts. The NuWave PIC Titanium is able to help consumers maximize their grocery budgets. Due to the PIC Titanium's precise temperature control, the oil used to prepare and fry foods, for example, may be continuously recycled. This helps reduce the number of trips to the grocery store, saving you both time and money. In fact, we've tested this very example in our test kitchen. Over 100 pieces of fried chicken were prepared with the exact same cooking oil on the NuWave Precision Induction Cooktop. At the conclusion of the frying, the oil remained relatively clear and could have been used to prepare additional chicken pieces. The NuWave PIC Titanium is built to last too, reducing consumers' need to replace appliances, as is often the case with lower-quality competitor models. We engineer the unit to meet an average lifespan of 13 to 15 years. Safety One of the most attractive features of induction cooking is its safety when compared with traditional gas or electric cooking methods. From the internal mechanisms to the exterior, the PIC Titanium is designed for security and peace of mind. Extreme testing has shown that even a paper or cotton towel placed atop the surface of the NuWave PIC Titanium will not catch fire. The PIC Titanium is built with redundant engineering features to further promote safety, including an automatic shutoff feature that makes the unit that much more desirable in homes where pets, children and elderly reside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316iQ6FEzCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B0174B20BY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0174B20BY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0174B20BY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
