window.products.push({"id":1095146,"name":"Top Cheese Mill | Finely Adjustable Black and White Coarse Grinder with Super Sharp Stainless Steel Blades and Removable Body for Nut Veggies Chocolat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51P2uf6L4tL._AC_SL1038_.jpg","description":"Top Cheese Mill(TM) The Most Efficient Grinder Tired of straining your arms when grinding hard cheese? then Top Cheese Mill (TM) is your solution! 9 out of 10 Users are delighted with the great result and efficiency created by a cheese mill in their kitchen. Why You Should Choose Top Cheese Mill (TM)? - Sharp blades - Durable built - Ergonomic design - Safe and easy to use Make Grating Fast and Enjoyable - Guaranteed! Top Cheese Mill(TM) has two distinct super sharp blades that can be used for any kind of cheeses, while its large body is designed to grate generous supply of any cheese and will allow you to mix different hard cheeses for grating. Made of ABS food-safe and anti rust stainless steel blades, it is safer and more sanitary than traditional graters. with 2.8 x 2.3 x 6.7 inches size, it is very compact and won't take any space at all in your kitchen. So what are you waiting for? Order now and fancy your kitchen with its beauty.   Click ADD TO CART Now! (c) Top Cheese Mill (TM) - All Rights Reserved Related searches: cheese mill adjustable fine coarse sharp stainless steel blade nut chocolate vegetable grinder grater; parmesan romano soft handle sturdy dishwasher safe kitchen tool; mix sanitary compact durable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51P2uf6L4tL._AC_SL1038_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Top Cheese Mill","source_asin":"B01KSWVI50","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KSWVI50","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KSWVI50","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1095147,"name":"DMT AKFNR Aligner Kit - Fine Diamond Whetstone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Jg04cscXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description DMT is recognized as the worldwide leader in Diamond knife sharpeners and sharpening products, with a diverse product line and reputation for quality and innovation. DMT's patented and award-winning products are known for their superior quality and versatility, are easy to use, and allow for sharpening in a fraction of the time required by other methods. DMT manufactures a full line of Diamond knife sharpeners and other sharpening tools for use in woodworking, culinary arts, gardening, camping, fishing, hunting, outdoor and winter sports, industrial applications and more. Amazon.com The DMT AKFNR Aligner Kit--Fine Diamond Whetstone Sharpening System takes the guesswork out of getting the perfect razor-sharp edge by using an adjustable blade guide that does it for you. This affordable sharpening system can be used on a wide array of knives and blades. With its innovative Fine Diamond Whetstone design and durable construction, you'll be assured of easy, efficient, and consistent sharpening for years to come. .caption {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica neue, Arial, serif;font-size: 10px;font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;}ul.indent {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: 20px;}table.callout {font-family: Verdana, Helvetica, Arial, serif;margin: 10px;width: 250;}td.callout {height: 100 percent;background: #9DC4D8 url(https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/electronics/detail-page/callout-bg.png) repeat-x;border-left: 1px solid #999999;border-right: 1px solid #999999;padding: 10px;width: 250px;}ul.callout {list-style: inside disc;text-indent: -12px;font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.5em;}h5.callout {text-align: center;} The DMT AKFNR Aligner Kit offers: A 4-inch Diamond Whetstone with a fine grit for razor-sharp edges A 4-inch Diamond Whetstone with a fine grit for razor-sharp edges Monocrystalline diamond sharpening surface for fast, effective sharpening Monocrystalline diamond sharpening surface for fast, effective sharpening An adjustable blade guide for precision and accuracy An adjustable blade guide for precision and accuracy The ability to sharpen dry or with water The ability to sharpen dry or with water Monocrystalline diamond surfaces sharpen faster and more efficiently. View larger . With seven angle settings, it's easy to keep an ideal edge on a wide variety of blades. View larger . Click to view all grit sizes available from DMT . Fast, Efficient, Safe Sharpening The Aligner Blade Guide works to keep the blade at the ideal angle for sharpening so that you don't have to. There are a total of seven angle settings, so it will work with practically any blade angle from razor blades to meat cleavers. The deep clamp design securely holds blades up to 3/8 inch in thickness while sharpening, and its engineered resin won't mar or scratch the blade of the knife like metal clamps will. The innovative four-inch Diamond Whetstone (25 micron / 600 mesh) gets a razor-sharp edge each time and in a fraction of the time it takes to sharpen blades with other sharpeners. DMT's exclusive monocrystalline diamond surface requires less blade pressure while sharpening--the diamond does all of the hard work! Also, these revolutionary DMT Diamond Whetstones require no messy oil: simply sharpen dry or with water. Clean-up is a breeze as well: simply rinse the stone with water, dry, and store in a dry place. The Aligner Sharpening System is not only quick and easy to use, but it's also extremely safe as well. The Aligner Clamp and four-inch Diamond Whetstone collectively produce the perfect edge on any blade while at the same time keeping your hands away from the blade. Get the job done more quickly and safely with the DMT Aligner Sharpening System. Tough, Compact Design DMT uses only the finest materials in their sharpeners, and their durable designs withstand the test of time. Not only is the DMT AKFNR Aligner Sharpener tough, but it's also very portable. The entire kit measures 10.50 x 7.50 x 1.25 inches (LxWxH) and weighs just 0.70 pounds. Included in the box, you'll find one four-inch Diamond Whetstone, a stone holder, blade guide, and instructions. About Diamond Machining Technology (DMT) Since 1976, Diamond Machining Technology (DMT) has been recognized as the leading innovator in diamond sharpening technology. They've pioneered such ground-breaking innovations as the DuoSharp bench stone, the Diamond Whetstone, and the Diafold Magna-Guide Sharpening System--all of which that have revolutionized the diamond knife and tool sharpening industry. Based out of Marlborough, Massachusetts , DMT continues to develop new and exciting diamond sharpening solutions for both consumer and commercial applications. DMT is committed to developing and producing the world's finest diamond knife and tool sharpeners. DMT takes pride in the fine workmanship of their products, and they only use the highest quality materials in their manufacturing process. All of their products are guaranteed to be free of defects, and","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Jg04cscXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DMT (Diamond Machining Technology)","source_asin":"B001AUAZAE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001AUAZAE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001AUAZAE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
