window.products.push({"id":1095173,"name":"LIFEREVO Luxury Faux Fur Throw Blanket Chevron Brushed Fleece with Crystal Velvet Mink Reversible, Super Soft, Smooth and Cozy Warm for All Seasons (A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hCAFBfO8L._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Fleece,velvet,faux Fur QUALITY MATERIALS: 10mm high pile , 320gsm fluffy plush faux fur fleece, chevron zigzag brushed pattern makes it dynamic and fashion. Color matched 200gsm crystal velvet mink reversible, better than normal. 4” border sewing line all around against two layers makes the whole throw more durable. ELEGANT DESIGN: Crafted from silky-soft short-pile faux fur reverses to solid dyed-to-match micro mink for a cozy blanket with trendy glam style. It’s a very suitable throw for four seasons as it’s balanced thickness and lightweight. Add stylish to your any room with this simple solid yet classy elegant design, four fashion-forward colors are available for easy mixing and matching with your home decor, perfect personal gift for any occasion. SIZE: 51\"X61\", 2.65 lb, draped over on the chair, bed, couch or sofa, keeps you warm on chilly time when snuggling, reading, or lounging.warm and comfortable through any season. Extremely cost-effective. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Machine wash cold on gentle cycle. Tumble dry on low heat or dry flat. Do not bleach. Do not Iron. Please refer to the care label. We suggest washing before first use as it sheds a bit for produce cutting. LIFEREVO appreciate you love our products like our other 5-star reviewers that we offer a 30-day return and replacement service. If you have any questions, please contact us to get a satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hCAFBfO8L._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFEREVO","source_asin":"B07993MGZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07993MGZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07993MGZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1095174,"name":"Jura 250 mL Milk System Cleaner for All Frothing Systems, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+VPEPMYeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your milk frothing equipment in top shape with this set of four bottles of Jura Milk System Cleaner. When you froth and steam, little milk droplets will stay inside the frother, requiring thorough cleaning. This detergent removes the need for taking apart your frothers, as you can simply throw all the parts that come in contact with milk into a cup with six ounces of water and a half ounce of the special concentrate. All milk fat will be removed in less than 10 minutes, keeping your parts fresh and working. Best of all, this concentrate works with all frothing systems. 250 mL","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+VPEPMYeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jura","source_asin":"B00MR3JOJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MR3JOJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MR3JOJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1095175,"name":"Citronella Candle by SoyVa | Freshly Scented Natural Soy Wax Candles | Luxury Double Wick Design | Hand Made in The USA, 9oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EArKmswWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Citronella is a rich, uplifting fragrance that is perfect for both indoors or outdoors. The unique double-wick design provides an even burn and enhances the scent throw spreading the rich scent of Citronella throughout the corners of your room. Each SoyVa scented candle is handcrafted in the USA with family grown and harvested all natural soy wax. Citronella fragrance oil is carefully blended into the wax one candle at a time to ensure consistency and high quality aromatherapy benefits. Our artisan candle pouring process and dedication to natural ingredients ensures that your clean burning candle is free of dyes, paraffin, phthalates, lead, and metal. The elegant SoyVa Citronella candle is just as clean and sophisticated on the inside as it looks from the outside. In order to enjoy the full benefits and extend the life of your candle, be sure to keep the wick trimmed to ¼ inch before every use and burn for a full two hours during the first use. This will allow the entire soy wax surface to melt, thereby establishing the burn memory for future use. As with all scented candles, be sure to follow all safety and warning precautions. 9oz. Hand made in the USA. THE BEST CUSTOMER SERVICE PROMISE AVAILABLE, PERIOD. With our famous 100% satisfaction promise, you can have peace of mind. If for any reason you're not completely happy with your product - if it breaks, if it's damaged in shipping, don’t like the smell, or even change your mind - simply let us know and we will either replace it or refund your money, your choice! From real people who love candles, SoyVa simply offers awesome customer service that can't be beat. IF YOU NEED ANY HELP AT ALL contact us directly and we will take care of you. There is absolutely no risk for you to purchase today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EArKmswWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SoyVa","source_asin":"B071V7GFDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071V7GFDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071V7GFDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
