window.products.push({"id":1095300,"name":"BALDR Mechanical 60-Minute Kitchen Timer with Dial | Stainless Steel Face and Magnetic Back - Retro Tick-Tick Sound, Easy to Use - Just Wind Up to Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T3octeQ4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This wind-up kitchen timer comes with a bold red dial, making it easy to tell how much time remains. Truly mechanical, it doesn’t run on batteries. To use, just turn the dial clockwise to the 59-minute mark, then counter-clockwise to your desired time. With a strong magnetic backing, it sticks to most stainless-steel appliances. Designed with a retro feel, it’s like what mom used to have. It even has that familiar tick-tick sound and “Ding!” ringer. Think beyond baking cookies, and use it for timing school tasks, like exams and homework.Features:1. Bold red dial makes it easy to tell how much time is left 2. Strong magnetic backing sticks to most metal surfaces (including stainless steel) 3. Timer counts up to 60 minutes 4. 100% mechanical, there’s no need for batteries5. Easy to use, you just turn the dial clockwise to the 59-minute mark then turn counter-clockwise to your desired time6. Makes a retro tick-tick sound when counting down7. Alarm bell is loud enough to hear but not annoying Specifications: Size: 2.4”L x 1.4”W x 2.4”H Net weight: 120g (4.2 oz)Gross weight: 140g (5.0 oz)Color: Black and stainless steelPackage Contains: 1x B01HPRJZ2E Mechanical Timer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T3octeQ4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALDR","source_asin":"B0C21D276M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C21D276M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C21D276M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
