window.products.push({"id":1095526,"name":"GaiaMade Water Hyacinth Storage Baskets with Lid, Wicker Baskets for Organizing and Storage, Set of 3 (1PC Large, 2PCS Medium, 1 Lid)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IMLUIDmoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SET OF 3: One large hyacinth basket 14.75x10.5x6.25\" , Two small basket 8.75x6.75x5.5 \", One Tray 15.25x11x2\". GaiaMade seagrass storage baskets feature two built-in handles offering a convenient and comfortable way to move them around. The water hyacinth threads are tightly woven together and can hold up to 40 pounds. The woven tray can be use as a lid keeping your belongings from collecting dust. MULTI-PURPOSE. The wicker storage basket set comes in different sizes - perfect to sort and store your essentials in living room, bedrooms, bathrooms, kids rooms / nursery, kitchen, and other rooms. Use our water hyacinth wicker basket together or in different rooms as needed. CONVENIENT AND SPACE-SAVING. Our large wicker basket with lid allow easy access and optimize any space for storage. The tray can be used as bread and fruit seagrass basket or serving tray for coffee table, snacks, food, and drinks. When not in use, the two small storage basket can be neatly stored in the larger bin to save space. ORGANIC AND CLASSIC DESIGN. The rustic water hyacinth basket can accentuate any room of your home offering storage and adding a unique highlight to your home. The wicker storage basket suits with different interior decor theme such as cabin, farmhouse, rustic, modern, and Bohemian. Our seagrass baskets set is also a thoughtful gift for your family and friends. PROUDLY MADE IN VIETNAM. Each rectangle wicker basket is hand-woven with passion and outstanding craftsmanship by Vietnamese artisans, using 100% eco-friendly and durable water hyacinth threads. We take great care in selecting these materials to ensure the quality of our woven baskets for storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IMLUIDmoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAIAMADE","source_asin":"B0B8YGM8BC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8YGM8BC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8YGM8BC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
