window.products.push({"id":1095549,"name":"Silent Metal Skeleton Wall Clock, Yohaoupty 40cm European Farmhouse Vintage Clock with Roman Numeral, Non-Ticking Battery Operated Hanging Wall Clock ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KS5XJx8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your home deserves something special! Add vintage style to your home with the Yohaoupty 40cm European retro clock. This exquisitely finished wall clock measures about 40cm in diameter so becomes a decorative focal point wherever you put it. ⏰Product details: Size : 40 cm, retro roman style Material : Iron with painting Color : Black ⏰Yohaoupty Decor Roman Numerals Wall Clock √Add vintage style to your home with the Yohaoupty 40cm European retro clock. This exquisitely finished wall clock measures about 40cm in diameter so becomes a decorative focal point wherever you put it. √Made of powder-coated steel, durable to use and weather-proof. √A lacquer dial in glossy finished stands out against the ultra-thin brushed golden hands, which is a exquisite hand welded iron artworks. √Perfect gift for your families or friends on birthday, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas etc. Check the clock working or not before hanging it: 1,Put in an AA 1.5V battery and watch the gear cap nut running or not. If will run that means the clock works good. 2,If the gear cap nut runs good,but the pointer won’t run with the gear,please following below step to fix it. 1):Remove all the pointers 2):Install the battery,if the movement is working means that pointer is not installed correctly 3):Install the pointer and it must be installed firmly and keep balance and not cross. Observe for few minutes,then the clock should work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KS5XJx8XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yohaoupty","source_asin":"B092W4JJD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092W4JJD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092W4JJD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
