window.products.push({"id":1095572,"name":"Charcuterie cheese Butterboard 55, Spalted Maple serving cutting board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91izpD3sVuL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"You’re viewing a special spalted maple charcuterie board with under side Ogee edge. The woods are from the center out: Spalted Maple, Walnut, Cherry and Walnut. Wood is a natural material and a product of nature, so in these special boards you will find variability in the grain patterns and colors. Center spalted board grain pattern varies from black lines to honey colors. This piece measures 26\" L x 7 1/4\" W (+- 1/4\") x 1 3/16\" thick. Printed cutting board care instructions are included and sold without accessories. This is finished with all natural mineral oil and then a coat of our proprietary blend of mineral oil and beeswax. Mineral oil is a non-drying oil, which means that it will not polymerize (form a plastic-like substance) over time. This is good for oiling wood surfaces that are in contact with water because it will stay a bit liquid in the wood and flow into cracks and scratches. It is also food-safe and won't go rancid or support microorganisms. Mineral oil is inexpensive and available at a wide variety of stores. Periodic reapplication of the oil after cleaning the board will return it to like new condition. Use mild soap during cleaning and it should not be submerged in water. If you have any questions please feel free to email us. Thanks for looking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91izpD3sVuL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01ASDMV5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ASDMV5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ASDMV5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
