window.products.push({"id":1095622,"name":"Mark Lewis Art Kurt Cobain Art Print 21\" x 25\" - adf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NCNAedIqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KURT COBAIN ART PRINT Now own a personally signed limited edition wall decor art print. Created from an original painting titled \"AS DARKNESS FELL\" and printed at Mark Lewis’ California studio, each of these elegant prints is created on high gloss fine art print paper. They are then assembled under UV acrylic glass and surrounded by a sheik 2 1/2\" matte black frame that measures 25” x 21”. This is an original limited edition art print with an edition size of 249 . A signed and numbered Certificate Of Authenticity will be included; the exact edition number you receive will depend on prior sales, and when the final number is sold the edition will be retired. Your personal order will arrive in a well-padded package for safe shipping. ABOUT MARK LEWIS ART Why should you buy Mark Lewis art today? Because in addition to its own artistic significance, this piece has fascinating relevance to the cultural and political history of the United States. The artist Mark Lewis is one of only a few surviving relatives (and the last in his lineage) of baseball legend Cy Young, the winning-est pitcher in MLB history. Mark is also the 10th Great Grandson of Richard Carder, who was one of the 23 signers of the first document in American history that severed both political and religious ties with England (the Portsmouth Compact in 1636) and formed a colony that would eventually become Portsmouth, Rhode Island. Due to these unique ancestral ties to such significant members of American history, combined with Mark's own artistic talent for painting and recreating famous photographs of Pop Culture icons, we believe that this piece is a sound investment for collectors of modern and contemporary American art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NCNAedIqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mark Lewis Art","source_asin":"B00HS9S1RA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HS9S1RA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HS9S1RA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
