window.products.push({"id":1095708,"name":"Stove Top Cover; Stove Top Tray; Noodle Board; Charcuterie Board; Cutting Board (Turquoise)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oMciRGSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"**ATTENTION** Please measure and confirm your stove top dimensions before ordering. (see dimensions below) Our covers are made to fit standard sized electric glass top stoves. These trays will not scratch the surface of your stove top. They are made to fit along the outside frame of your stove so the underside will not be touching the glass surface. Electric Flat Stove Top Sizing: 29.5\" Long x 21.5\" Wide x 1\" High **The height measurement does not include the metal pipe handles. **NATURAL TONES WILL VARY DUE TO BEING BUILT FROM RECLAIMED WOOD! Comes fully assembled with two raw metal pipe handles for added industrial flair. Each cover is built from reclaimed wood and sanded for a clean finish (please note that the underside will be left unpainted.) This is such a clever way to give your stove a face lift. Can also be used to accent a coffee table or ottoman. Please keep in mind that this is reclaimed wood so old nail holes and cracks are a part of what adds the character to these one-of-a-kind pieces. No two pieces will be the exact same and occasional splinters may be present.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oMciRGSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Doug and Cristy Designs","source_asin":"B0B4TW5Y14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4TW5Y14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4TW5Y14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
