window.products.push({"id":1095944,"name":"Moonen Flannel Throw Blanket Luxurious Throw Size Lightweight Plush Microfiber Fleece Comfy All Season Super Soft Cozy Blanket for Bed Couch and Gift ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gtnetxw1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"📙 Experience the comforts of our shaggy throw blanket! Moonen blankets are designed with all season versatility in our mind, made with premium, silky soft fleece, they're surely your must-have companion. Keep it on your bed or couch for extra coziness, or in your car for perfectly portable comfort. It makes a great gift for your friends and family. Even pets will claim their love to the blankets! 📙 Beyond the super soft touch, they're also: ✔️Made of 100% Microfiber Polyester, making blankets lightweight yet extremely durable. ✔️The fine fibers give it hypoallergenic properties, making it perfect for people with sensitive skin or allergies. ✔️Wrinkle and fade resistant, not easy to shed, free of wrinkling. Breathable, anti-pill and anti-static. ✔️Easily keep you warm at effective cheap cost, the big long 90x90 inches can be an alternative of your thermal warmer.  ✔️Useful as a decorative home décor for housewarming, no matter you're sleeping in your bedroom, or enjoying yourself in a living room. ✔️Wide colors range to match various house themes, the material offers silk looking, add warmth with elegance. ✔️Easy to maintain, machine washable. 📙 A serious manufacturing process. The finishing process involves environmental protection techniques that enable the fabric to hold onto dye and prevent fading. It also undergoes a brushing treatment three times for an extra smooth feel, along with a lustering treatment that gives it a glossy, velvety finish. Along the edges of the blanket, the stitching is smooth, fine, and compact. We only consider the best in the manufacture of our products to ensure superior quality for the price, and go through painstaking measures to make sure it exceeds your expectations. Enjoy it for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gtnetxw1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moonen","source_asin":"B078WSCKHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078WSCKHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078WSCKHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
