window.products.push({"id":1095984,"name":"Grasslands Road Coffee Cake Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DigcDKgxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a lovely baking dish with sculpted ceramic detail on the rim and inside the dish. It is finished with holly leaves and berries detail as well as embossed scrolls in the bottom of the dish. It measures 10.5 diameter x 2 inches deep, the inside diameter is 7.25 inches. The baking dish is hand painted and is oven proof, dishwasher and microwave safe making it a truly versatile table piece for the Christmas Season. The coffee cake recipe included in the dish reads: 3/4 stick softened butter, 1 cup sugar, 1 1/2 cups flour, 2 tsps. baking powder, 1/4 tsp. salt, 1 egg and 1/2 plus 1/8 cup butter milk. FOR THE TOPPING: 3/4 stick softened butter, 1/3 cup flour, 3/4 cup brown sugar, 1 tbsp. cinnamon. Preheat oven to 350 degrees F, grease dish. CAKE INSTRUCTIONS: Cream butter and sugar, add egg and beat until fluffy. In a separate bowl combine flour, baking powder and salt. Add dry ingredients to sugar mixture and combine. Add buttermilk and mix. Spread batter into dish. TOPPING INSTRUCTIONS: Combine all topping ingredients in bowl. Mix until combined. Crumble over batter. Bake for 40-45 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DigcDKgxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grasslands Road","source_asin":"B00ET80WQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1095984","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ET80WQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ET80WQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
